    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27910" root="عبو" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِبْوٌ</span></b>  <i>A weight,</i> or <i>load,</i> or <i>burden:</i> or <i>any load,</i>
or <i>burden, consisting of a debt,</i> or <i>some other responsibility that one takes upon himself.</i> (TA.)
[See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِبْءٌ</span> (which signifies the same) in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عبأ</span>.]

